      },
      {
       "actor": {
        "who": "professor",
        "take": "varahi",
        "anim": "pick-up"
       }
      },
      {
       "say": {
        "who": "professor",
        "line": "She is Varahi, one of the saptamatrikas. She is pot bellied, for she holds in her womb the universe.",
        "sources": [
         "novel ¶147"
        ]
       }
      },
      {
       "say": {
        "who": "dvij",
        "line": "I am really sorry.",
        "sources": [
         "novel ¶148"
        ]
       }
      },
      {
       "say": {
        "who": "professor",
        "line": "Oh, don't be a fool. It's impossible to find anything intact, really speaking, including our history. All we see now are small fragments.",
        "sources": [
         "novel ¶149"
        ]
       }
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "questions",
     "sources": [
      "breakdown ch3 p7-p10",
      "novel ¶150-155"
     ],
     "do": [
      {
       "say": {
        "who": "dvij",
        "line": "Why is my head bandaged?",
        "sources": [
         "novel ¶150"
        ]
       }
      },
      {
       "actor": {
        "who": "professor",
        "take": "manuscript",
        "anim": "talk"
       }
      },
      {
       "say": {
        "who": "professor",
        "line": "Why indeed? Because of the accident, I should think. Careless driving, I dare say. Must you fret about those things when we are in the midst of such secret knowledge?",
        "sources": [
         "novel ¶151"
        ]
       }
      },
      {
       "say": {
        "who": "dvij",
        "line": "I had a car accident?",
        "sources": [
         "novel ¶152"
        ]
       }
      },
      {
       "say": {
        "who": "professor",
        "line": "Yes, yes, of course you had an accident. You were in coma. Look here... at the edges of the birch barks... see how they have frayed over time. Beautiful!",
        "sources": [
         "novel ¶153"
        ]
       }
      },
      {
       "say": {
        "who": "dvij",
        "line": "Why? Why was I in a coma?",
        "sources": [
         "novel ¶154"
        ]
       }
      },
      {
       "actor": {
        "who": "professor",
        "look": "player"
       }
      },
      {
       "say": {
        "who": "professor",
        "line": "Well! It's all very simple really. You had an accident. You hurt your head. You went into a coma. Now, if we could get back to the book, I'd appreciate very much.",
        "sources": [
         "novel ¶155"
        ]
       }
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "introduction",
     "sources": [
      "breakdown ch3 p11-p14",
      "novel ¶157-162"
     ],
     "do": [
      {
       "say": {
        "who": "professor",
        "line": "Become the intrepid explorer and find the text, my boy, for it would help you find your past.",
        "sources": [
         "novel ¶157"
        ]
       }
      },
      {
       "say": {
        "who": "dvij",
        "line": "My past?",
        "sources": [
         "novel ¶158"
        ]
       }
      },
      {
       "say": {
        "who": "professor",
        "line": "I haven't really introduced myself, have I? How embarrassing. I am Doctor Vidyasagar Parthasarathi, owner of this room and the rest of the lodge that came along with it.",
        "sources": [
         "novel ¶159"
        ]
       }
      },
      {
       "say": {
        "who": "dvij",
        "line": "I woke up in a strange room, walked out into a courtyard, and then into this room. Next thing I remember is you asking me for your glasses.",
        "sources": [
         "novel ¶160"
        ]
       }
      },
      {
       "say": {
        "who": "professor",
        "line": "Think nothing of it! It's your turn to introduce yourself. What's your name? Come on, out with it.",
        "sources": [
         "novel ¶161"
        ]
       }
      },
      {
       "say": {
        "who": "dvij",
        "line": "I... I don't know!",
        "sources": [
         "novel ¶162"
        ]
       }
      },
      {
       "effect": {
        "faint": true,
        "over": 2
       }
      },
      {
       "sound": "thud"
      },
      {
